<title>INDONESIA: Tempo Scan H1 net edges higher.</title>
<headline>Tempo Scan H1 net edges higher.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    24.79 vs 23.44</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    165 vs 313</p>
<p>    Net sales			    224.07 vs 121.07</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    35.19 vs 25.53</p>
<p>Note: PT Tempo Scan Pacific said a drop in earnings per share reflected an increase in the firm's shares to 150 million shares with nominal value of 500 rupiah in 1996 against 75 million shares with nominal value of 1,000 rupiah in 1995.</p>
</text>
